on exitFrame
  [  0] pushcons 0 .............................. <"hitback">
  [  2] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [  5] set 0 ................................... set the keyDownScript to "hitback"
  [  7] pushint8 13 ............................. <13>
  [ 10] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 13] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <13, 1>
  [ 15] extcall 15 .............................. puppetSprite(13, 1)
  [ 17] pushint8 7 .............................. <7>
  [ 20] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 23] pusharglistnoret 2 ...................... <7, 1>
  [ 25] extcall 15 .............................. puppetSprite(7, 1)
  [ 27] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 30] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 31] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 32] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 33] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 34] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [ 37] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 38] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 39] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 40] pushvarref 7 ............................ <runcount>
  [ 42] putchunk 18 ............................. put 1 into item 3 of runcount
  [ 44] ret
end
